{"schema_version":"1.0.0","id":"cik-0001809104","cik":"0001809104","slug":"alight-inc-delaware-809104","name":"Alight, Inc. / Delaware","ticker":"ALIT","exchanges":["NYSE"],"sector":"Services-Business Services, NEC","sic":"7389","country":"IL","website":"","listed_years":5.4,"first_annual":"2021-02-26","last_filing":"2026-07-27","annual_only":false,"edgar_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001809104&type=10-K","summary":{"sentences":["Alight, Inc. / Delaware files with the SEC under \"Services-Business Services, NEC\", based in IL, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $2.1bn of revenue over the trailing four quarters, down 2.6% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 29.2%.","Listed on NYSE, it funds itself from operations ($324.0m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $324.0m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809104/000162828026030596/0001628280-26-030596-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030596"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-1.4% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809104/000162828026030596/0001628280-26-030596-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030596"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 2.6% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809104/000162828026030596/0001628280-26-030596-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030596"},{"text":"Gross margin compressed from 31.2% to 29.2% against the same quarter a year earlier. Either input costs are rising or the company is discounting to hold volume.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809104/000162828026030596/0001628280-26-030596-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030596"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-4.1% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809104/000162828026030596/0001628280-26-030596-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030596"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $14.0m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809104/000162828026030596/0001628280-26-030596-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030596"},{"text":"Debt of $2.0bn against equity of $1.0bn. Leverage decides who controls the outcome if trading deteriorates, and it is not the shareholder.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809104/000162828026030596/0001628280-26-030596-index.htm","accession":"0001628280-26-030596"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.1% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1809104/000162828026049047/0001628280-26-049047-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 21.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.21,"consecutive":2,"current":0.292,"current_display":"29.2%","threshold_display":"21.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than n